        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani gwanung'usa heeda ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwariiy Sulemani gadeemga eemoojiga: huda Farao, ea gea eemeeda Moabu, ea Amoni, ea Edomu, ea Sidoni, ea Hiti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba jeeda eemoojiga ghayi eesha NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli, “Adiidu googeenay geat sea saawa, aba huumwa gayghwayam gurooruunatkeagwa ak ghoabwachi aseecheeka nyaawa.” Hean Sulemani ghang'ut bariinyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaghi gadeem bughalaji ispwa was haweega sugoodiga, ea gadeemga was gwealaji bughalaji samwagu, hean ghwayam gurooroadaanyi gadeemgaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghawaasiit Sulemani, ghwayam gurooroadaanyi gadeemgaaschi ghabwat aseecheeka suuk; nea gurooroadaanyi ea mudu ea doabiiwaat aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI, gawuurji guroorooda Dawdeeda was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaat Sulemani geeshta Ashtoreti was aseeta gatmooda bea eemoojiga Sidoni ea Milkomu was munyinda aba heeda eemoojiga Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin Sulemani riing'eeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea ea masisiina mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gidaghayi sinda Dawdeeda was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwadeeksa Sulemani Gemoshi heeda geaw was munyinda aba heeda eemeeda Moabu, ea Moleki was munyinda aba heeda eemeeda Amoni, aba uhuuda giijeeda was gayeewda Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwahindunu aba heeda gadeemgaaschi sean bea eemoojiga, inyeesa ghoadaw aseecheeka nyaawa lukghumajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwanyareeksa NG'UTAMIIDA Sulemani, aba gideaba niyamwa geaw gurooroadaanyi aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA fuga Israeli, abeeda niihiimsa geaw niba iyeenya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ea niidaw diigheanda aba ng'asheesu, gideaba adiidu ghabwat aseecheeka suuk, ak ea masisiina mureeda gidarukusa NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Sulemani, “Nih ghamneawa fughareadaang'u gil nea misisiini mureeda neajeedeanyu ea doobiiwnacheekeasu ghayi eagoonyeey, aba huumwa gaydageanda gheambalmeeda aba headaang'u ak gaydaadaw siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nea aba badayda Dawdeeda was ghweandaang'u may dasin ng'asheanji aba jeeda eawoojigaagu, gaydageanda aba geatinga orjeedang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gicha ea maydahuta gheambalmoojiga sean; gaydaadaw eemeanagi orjeedang'u; aba badayda Dawdeeda was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda ea aba badayda Yerusalemu ghayi ealoosi geaw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Weajoodiga Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA ghang'eat weajoocheanda aba badayda Sulemani, nih Hadadi, bea eemeeda Edomu; niny gaba jeeda sugoodiga aba Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda mideewa Dawdi ng'eanyiida Edomu, ea Yoabuheeda was shirikarajeanda lugooda gawa gabuy fuga sibwar, gabuy headiga sean aba Edomu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(aba gideaba Yoabu ea fuga sean bea Israeli goobiida hoowa sheeh lah, bwak ea gahuuyda headiga sean bea Edomu); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Hadadi niny gamng'awsa ng'eanyiida Misri, sea fiisu ng'ay bea eemeeda Edomu was fuga ghwaan bea gadiyeeda, nea abeeda Hadadi ea gudu ea baleanda mwanang' gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada Midiyani bwak ea ghapka Barani, ak goodeayi sea headiga aba Barani ea ghwahita Misri, heeda Faraoheeda was sugoocheanda Misri, ak ghoadaw gheeda, ea hamita ea madamnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanyas Hadadi miyinda haw aba madeeda Farao, ghoadaw huda geenyea gatmoadaanyi ghaghi, huda geenyea Dahpenesi was gatmooda was sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean huda geenyea Dahpenesi gwajiilsa Hadadi orjeeda siguura Genubati, ak gooreersa Dahpenesi jeeda gheeda Farao; hean Genubati goobiida jeeda gheeda Farao aba bugusta orjooga Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata nea gwayiing'sa Misri Hadadi gideaba Dawdi nimeawda gidaghayi meawda ghweanigaaschi, ea gideaba Yoabuheeda was shirikarajeanda lugooda goola ghami, gwayeesha Hadadi Farao, “Sikseani dawa, dabiikta ng'eanyiideanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Farao, “Ghwasheadaweey naaha aba heedeanyu bwak ea gasa biikteayda ng'eanyiidaang'u?” Hean gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i sikseani dawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goong'eesa ASEETA niny weajoocheanda, Resoni was orjeeda Eliyada, mang'awna heeda siidaanyi bea mureeda siguura Hadadeseri was sugoocheanda Soba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoamughuush headiga ak ghoah siida haw bea lugooda, damanda bwara Dawdi buuneeda; hean gaweay Dameski, ak goobiida hoowa, ak geekghaambiit niny ghoah sugoocheanda Dameski. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoah weajoocheanda eemeeda Israeli aba eemoojiga sean bea Sulemani, gwasin gidaghayi sin Hadadi; ak ghwasit fuga Israeli, ak goombal ng'eanyiida Shaamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeleesiinda ASEETA aba heeda Yeroboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu was orjeeda Nebati, bea eemeeda Efraimu bea ng'eanyiida Sereda, was siida gadiyeeda bea Sulemani, nea ghaamwat geeguura Seruwa, was masinung'weanda, hean gagatkat geatindaanyi aba sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoah gidagatkasa geatindaanyi sugoocheanda. Sulemani ghwadeas Milo ak gwadukuta heeda saawa bea mujiineeda Dawdeeda was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yeroboamu gaba uurda haw, hean ghwadaah Sulemani gideaba orjeedida ea haw uur ghwanung' ghoah siichea gamiineadaysa fuga gadiyeeda hang'waay bea gheeda Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida ghabeawa Yerusalemu, ak ghwanyas sibaneeda siguura Ahiya, was siida eemeeda Shiloni aba gheata naweeda. Nea Ahiya abeeda gookwa hang'da eesh; nea abeeda gwandeawa geat duwaawi aba ng'eanyiida bwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoang'waay Ahiya hang'da ghwanyawa akwa, ak ghabwaashaada ea ghoah weageak damaniyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yeroboamu, “Geanda weageak damanamughuush ghoah gaagu” aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli, ‘Ng'ula, niriikghta dageanda gheambalmeeda aba geatinga Sulemani, ak geagoonyeeyi eemooji damanamughuush ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(nea niny gajeanung'wa eemeanagi, aba badayda Dawdeeda was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda ea aba badayda Yerusalemu, mujiineeda ghayi ealoosi geaw aba bugusta eemoojiga sean bea Israeli), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba saawa gwajaktanean, ak ghabwat Ashtoreti aseeta was gatmooda bea eemeeda Sidoni, ea Gemoshi was aseeta eemeeda Moabu, ea Milkoni was aseeta eemeeda Amoni, nea mwaada naweadingeasu, ak gwasin ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeedeanyu, nea ghoang'waay doobiiwnacheekeasu ea deaweedajeegeasu, gawuurji gidasinda Dawdeeda was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ea maydageandeawa geatingaaschi sugoocheanduumeeda sean; gaydanung' ghoah siichea goombaliischi aba jeeda eawoojigaaschi sean, aba badayda Dawdeeda was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda ghayi aaloachi ang'waay diigheanyeekeasu ea huumeanyeekeasu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gaydageandeawa gheambalmeeda geatinga orjeedaanyi ak geagoonyeeyi ang'iing'i eemooji damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak orjeedaanyi gaydaadaw eemeanagi, aba gideaba Dawdeeda was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda gwandeawa gheaboong'nyeanda aba madeedeanyu aba Yerusalemu, mujiineeda aaloachi dayiin gheawungeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaanyi ang'iing'i, ak gajambala buuneesean gasa gurooroadaang'u, ak gayhuuwa sugoocheanda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas gajaleeysiina iit gida earukuneey sean, ak giweewi naweadingeasu, ak gisini doobiiwnata aba madeedeanyu aba ging'ooyda huumeanyeekeasu ea diigheanyeekeasu, gawuurji gidasin Dawdeeda was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda, abeeda gajeendeayeena, ak gaydadeekneey gheeda huumwa, gawuurji gideadeeksiindi Dawdi, ak gaydagoonyi Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheanji gaydasawan jeacheenga Dawdi, nea majea gweanyeeka sean gil.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagasa Sulemani gwanuus Yeroboamu; ng'ata ghang'eat Yeroboamu, ak gamng'awsa ng'eanyiida Misri, heeda Shishaki was sugoocheanda Misri, hean goobiida Misri bwak ea ghami Sulemani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gadiyoojiga huuydeanda bea Sulemani, ea ng'asheega sean ghayi sin, ea weaghuumeadaanyi, meeng'oorsiina jeeda gitaabooda gadiyoojiga Sulemani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea damanda ambal Sulemani Yerusalemu ea eemeeda sean bea Israeli gweanyeew ea haradam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gwalil Sulemani sea ghweanigaaschi, ak geebung'sa jeeda mujiineeda Dawdeeda was ghwaan; ak goombaliischi orjeedaanyi was Rehoboamu ak ghoang'waay hoorgeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
